// tok_precedes_1(n): a later sibling of n, a named node or an anonymous token, matches "^as$": a named node, a token the tape stores, or one it leaves out, read from the source between stored children
.decl fast003_tok_precedes_1(n: node)
.stored fast003_tok_precedes_1 "its token reads are of tokens the tape stores; one the tape leaves out is read from the source gap, in its own rule"
fast003_tok_precedes_1(n) :- precedes(n, s9), glob("as", s9).
